cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PV Signal Radar, cite the software release and the immutable dataset/analysis bundle used in your work."
title: "PV Signal Radar"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Maeda"
    given-names: "Bruno"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BMaeda84/pv-signal-radar"
url: "https://github.com/BMaeda84/pv-signal-radar"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source platform and reproducible batch-data scaffold for education,
  exploration, and academic research on disproportionate reporting in public
  pharmacovigilance datasets. Outputs are hypotheses for qualified review and
  do not establish causality, incidence, or regulatory confirmation.
keywords:
  - pharmacovigilance
  - disproportionality analysis
  - FAERS
  - reproducible research
  - drug safety
